@ScheduleService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5043

GET {{ScheduleService_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Add Sample Slots for Testing
POST {{ScheduleService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/slots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": 3,
  "date": "2024-05-15T00:00:00",
  "startTime": "PT9H",
  "endTime": "PT10H",
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

### Add More Sample Slots
POST {{ScheduleService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/slots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "providerId": 3,
  "date": "2024-05-15T00:00:00",
  "startTime": "PT11H",
  "endTime": "PT12H",
  "durationMinutes": 60
